@startuml
title Morpho Blue liquidation and bad debt
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A78B5
start
:Liquidator calls liquidate(seizedAssets or repaidShares);
:Accrue interest, read oracle price();
if (collateral x price x LLTV >= debt?) then (yes)
  :revert HEALTHY_POSITION;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:LIF = min(1.15, 1 / (1 - 0.3 x (1 - LLTV)));
:Seize collateral worth repaid debt x LIF;
if (borrower collateral == 0 and debt left?) then (yes)
  :Remove remaining debt from totalBorrowAssets
  and totalSupplyAssets (bad debt);<<#FDEEEE>>
  :Every supplier's share is worth less;
else (no)
endif
:Callback (optional), then pull repaid loan assets;
stop
@enduml
